{{!
    @template mod_these/settings_menu

    Menu déroulant « Paramètres » de la barre de navigation : les pages de paramétrage, rarement
    ouvertes, regroupées derrière un seul bouton.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * label Libellé du bouton.
    * items Liens : label, url.

    Example context (json):
    {"label": "Paramètres", "items": [
        {"label": "Modèles des documents", "url": "https://example.com/mod/these/doctemplates.php?id=2"},
        {"label": "Annuaire du jury", "url": "https://example.com/mod/these/jurors.php?id=2"}
    ]}
}}
<div class="dropdown d-inline-block mr-1 mb-1"><button class="btn btn-secondary dropdown-toggle" type="button" id="these-settings-menu-{{uniqid}}" data-toggle="dropdown" data-bs-toggle="dropdown" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false">{{label}}</button><div class="dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-right dropdown-menu-end" aria-labelledby="these-settings-menu-{{uniqid}}">{{#items}}<a class="dropdown-item" href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a>{{/items}}</div></div>
